window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Legends of the Guardian King Book 3—Karen Hancock has created a beautiful and powerful fantasy series that continues to win new fans and remind them of who holds their hopes and victories in His hands.</p> <p>In Abramm's world, God is close to his followers, evil takes many forms, and one must believe in the light to see the darkness. While Abramm's coronation is still underway, rival leaders are already plotting their return to power.</p> <p>Worse yet, as the hour approaches for Abramm's marriage to the Chesedhan crown princess—required to seal the desperately needed alliance between their two countries—he finds himself deeply attracted to her younger sister. Will Eidon give Abramm ultimate victory, or will his enemies succeed in destroying him and his beloved realm?</p>"; 
